Optimism Aave V3 Fork Withdraw

GIVEN the Optimism child Aave v3 adapter
  WHEN a caller other than the vault withdraws
    THEN it reverts
  WHEN the vault performs an epoch withdraw
    THEN USDC returns from live Aave v3 and TVL decreases
  WHEN the vault withdraws the max amount
    THEN all supplied USDC returns from live Aave v3
